[19.5217, "o", "\r.... ...  .... ... ..... ........  ......\u001b[K"]
[19.602, "o", "\r\u001b[K\u001b[1m┌─── S00  Boot and trust boundary  \u001b[0m\u001b[32;1m[LIVE]\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.6024, "o", "\u001b[35m┌─ CONCEPTUAL EXPLANATION (ILLUSTRATIVE) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.6378, "o", "\u001b[35m│ Cold open: one real question about the Lear backend. It may be answered only from pinned Lear    │\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.6734, "o", "\u001b[35m│ documentation, and an answer counts only if every claim traces to a retrieved chunk and to Lear  │\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.7091, "o", "\u001b[35m│ source lines at one commit; without evidence the agent must abstain. The Lear repository is the  │\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.7441, "o", "\u001b[35m│ subject; RAG Formation is the instrument. Model traffic may only go to a loopback Ollama.        │\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.7795, "o", "\u001b[35m└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[19.8149, "o", "  \u001b[36;1m[RECORDED]\u001b[0m the question (golden lear-012): Does `prash run --dry-run` execute the action?\r\n  \u001b[35;1m[ILLUSTRATIVE]\u001b[0m system: RAG Formation / Lear Local Agent (the answering system)\r\n  \u001b[35;1m[ILLUSTRATIVE]\u001b[0m subject corpus: Lear backend repository, via source-pinned docs in docs/lear_backend\r\n  \u001b[32;1m[LIVE]\u001b[0m rag-formation commit: 954c8d624515 on arena/227b3998-rag-formation\r\n  \u001b[36;1m[RECORDED]\u001b[0m source pin: aviunion1348-cloud/Lear-backend-Avi @ 60cf9abf8408 (main)\r\n  \u001b[32;1m[LIVE]\u001b[0m backend: baseline (BASELINE / NOT QUALIFYING)\r\n  \u001b[32;1m[LIVE]\u001b[0m Ollama endpoint: 127.0.0.1:11434 (loopback: allowed)\r\n  \u001b[36;1m[RECORDED]\u001b[0m qualification: BLOCKED\r\n"]
