[116.3374, "o", "\u001b[33m  limitation: \u001b[0mPipeline-only: no LLM decode is included in any latency shown here.\r\n\u001b[90m  [Enter] next [p] auto [b] back [n] next [0-11] jump [r] replay [d/e] detail [m] models [?] help [q] quit\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[122.1364, "o", "\r.... ...  ...... ... ..... .........  ......\u001b[K"]
[122.2166, "o", "\r\u001b[K\u001b[1m┌─── S11  Report and final readiness  \u001b[0m\u001b[32;1m[LIVE]\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[122.2167, "o", "\u001b[35m┌─ CONCEPTUAL EXPLANATION (ILLUSTRATIVE) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[122.2521, "o", "\u001b[35m│ The report lists every recorded run separately. Readiness follows the weakest gate.              │\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[122.2873, "o", "\u001b[35m└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[122.3226, "o", "  \u001b[32;1m[LIVE]\u001b[0m report runs listed: 7\r\n  \u001b[32;1m[LIVE]\u001b[0m doctor ready now: False\r\n  \u001b[36;1m[RECORDED]\u001b[0m recorded decision: BLOCKED\r\n  \u001b[36;1m[RECORDED]\u001b[0m visible limitation: conflicts: the core conflict detector compares numeric day/hour/% units across two sources; golden lear-059 is outside it and comes back GROUNDED on the baseline\r\n  \u001b[32;1m[LIVE]\u001b[0m visible limitation: partial: 0 PARTIAL answers across 7 recorded runs: PARTIAL is not demonstrated\r\n  \u001b[32;1m[LIVE]\u001b[0m OVERALL: BLOCKED — LOCAL OLLAMA MODEL QUALIFICATION NOT COMPLETED IN THE RECORDED ENVIRONMENT.\r\n"]
[122.3228, "o", "\u001b[31m┌─ READINESS ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[122.3581, "o", "\u001b[31m│ OVERALL: BLOCKED                                                                                 │\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[122.3933, "o", "\u001b[31m│ 1. Install and start Ollama on a machine whose downloads are allowed (it must listen on          │\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[122.4286, "o", "\u001b[31m│ 127.0.0.1).                                                                                      │\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[122.4638, "o", "\u001b[31m│ 2. Pull nomic-embed-text, qwen2.5:1.5b and llama3.2:1b, then verify each from /api/show          │\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[122.4991, "o", "\u001b[31m│ metadata.                                                                                        │\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[122.5343, "o", "\u001b[31m│ 3. Run `python3 -m ragformation lear doctor` and require exit 0.                                 │\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[122.5697, "o", "\u001b[31m│ 4. Build the model-backed index: `python3 -m ragformation lear index rebuild --full`.            │\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[122.6049, "o", "\u001b[31m│ 5. Run real generation and the separate judge: `python3 -m ragformation lear eval run --suite    │\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[122.6401, "o", "\u001b[31m│ calibration,dev --judge on`.                                                                     │\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[122.6754, "o", "\u001b[31m│ 6. Recalibrate the ollama abstention threshold on calibration/dev data only.                     │\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[122.7107, "o", "\u001b[31m│ 7. Score the test split once under the frozen policy; the holdout was already used once, so a    │\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[122.7459, "o", "\u001b[31m│ qualifying final claim needs a new, openly versioned check set.                                  │\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[122.7812, "o", "\u001b[31m│ 8. Run `python3 -m ragformation lear bench --users 1,2,5` with model streaming enabled.          │\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[122.8164, "o", "\u001b[31m└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[122.8518, "o", "\u001b[90m  [Enter] next [p] auto [b] back [n] next [0-11] jump [r] replay [d/e] detail [m] models [?] help [q] quit\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[130.7405, "o", "\u001b[90m── demo exit 0 (OK) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[0m\r\n"]
